<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-QUALIFIERS FOR MIAMI INDYCAR RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-QUALIFIERS FOR MIAMI INDYCAR RACE.</headline>
<dateline>HOMESTEAD, Florida 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading qualifiers</p>
<p>on Saturday for Sunday's Miami IndyCar race (tabulate by</p>
<p>driver, country, chassis, engine and lap time):</p>
<p>1. Alex Zanardi (Italy), Reynard Honda, 28.000 seconds</p>
<p>(195.043 mph/313.883 kph)</p>
<p>2. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes, 28.025</p>
<p>3. Gil de Ferran (Brazil), Reynard Honda, 28.050</p>
<p>4. Greg Moore (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 28.150</p>
<p>5. Mark Blundell (Britain), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 28.277</p>
<p>6. Jimmy Vasser (U.S.), Reynard Honda, 28.301</p>
<p>7. Parker Johnstone (U.S.), Reynard Honda, 28.313</p>
<p>8. Raul Boesel (Brazil), Reynard Honda, 28.334</p>
<p>9. Patrick Carpentier (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 28.384</p>
<p>10. Al Unser Jr (U.S.), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 28.419</p>
